@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084

### Complete example: normal parcel (DEBUG + INFO in the console)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/examples/shipping-quote?weightKg=3

### Complete example: heavy parcel (also a WARN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/examples/shipping-quote?weightKg=40

### Approved payment, with your own correlation id (expect INFO)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-1

{"customerEmail":"anna.petrosyan@example.com","cardNumber":"4111111111111111","amount":250.00,"currency":"AMD"}

### Declined payment, over the limit (expect WARN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail":"anna.petrosyan@example.com","cardNumber":"4111111111111111","amount":5000,"currency":"AMD"}

### Provider outage: card ending with 0000 (expect 502 and one ERROR with a stack trace)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail":"anna.petrosyan@example.com","cardNumber":"4111111111110000","amount":250.00,"currency":"AMD"}

### Invalid body (expect 400 and a WARN with field names only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail":"not-an-email","cardNumber":"123","amount":0,"currency":"amd"}
